OL,3,APolice should not be scared to wade in
OL,4,Ato stop wrongdoing, says Badenoch
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch has
OL,7,Fcriticised punishments for people who
OL,8,Fintervene to "do the right thing" in a
OL,9,Fspeech at the Police Federation
OL,10,Fconference.
OL,12,FTelling delegates she was "not scared
OL,13,Fto wade in", she called for more
OL,14,Fsupport for members of the public as
OL,15,Fwell as police officers who step in to
OL,16,Fstop wrongdoing.
OL,18,FBadenoch also criticised Labour for
OL,19,Ffailing to send a minister to the
OL,20,Fconference for two years in a row.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
