OL,3,APolice should not be scared to wade in
OL,4,Ato stop wrongdoing, says Badenoch
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister's official deputy
OL,7,Fspokeswoman rejected the claims,
OL,8,Fstating the police have the
OL,9,Fgovernment's "full backing" and are
OL,10,Fbenefitting from investment. The BBC
OL,11,Fhas contacted the Home Office for
OL,12,Fcomment on ministerial attendance at
OL,13,Fthe police conference.
